meta {
  name: List products
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # List products

  Returns the Lpaecomms product catalogue with the Gold Coast store location
  where each product is available. Backs two mashups: the interactive map and
  the currency converter. Mobile and desktop clients use the same endpoint.

  The catalogue itself comes from an external demo feed; the store locations are
  merged in by the server, because the feed carries no coordinates. Prices are
  expressed in AUD.

  ## Auth

  None. This endpoint is public.

  ## Parameters

  None.

  ## Responses

  ### 200 OK — catalogue returned

  An array of up to five products, in display order.

  [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Classic Red Pullover",
      "priceAud": 10,
      "imageUrl": "https://i.imgur.com/1twoaDy.jpeg",
      "store": "Surfers Paradise",
      "latitude": -28.0023,
      "longitude": 153.4145
    }
  ]

  Fields:

  - `id` (number) — product identifier from the catalogue feed.
  - `name` (string) — product name.
  - `priceAud` (number) — base price in Australian dollars.
  - `imageUrl` (string) — product image; empty string when the feed has none.
  - `store` (string) — Gold Coast store holding the product.
  - `latitude` (number) — store latitude, WGS 84.
  - `longitude` (number) — store longitude, WGS 84.

  ### 502 Bad Gateway — catalogue source unavailable

  The upstream catalogue is unreachable, timed out after 5 seconds, or answered
  a non-2xx status. The fault is upstream, not in this service.

  {
    "statusCode": 502,
    "error": "Bad Gateway",
    "message": "The product catalogue source is unavailable.",
    "validation": [],
    "url": "/api/v1/products",
    "method": "GET"
  }
}
